    "detailed_description": "In the game, you become a driver of a car that carries various goods to remote villages,<br>located in snowy areas. The player's task is to complete various missions.<br>There are only three types of them - for the delivery of goods, for the collection of fuel and for the collection of fuel with replenishment of fuel in the gas tank.<br>Each completed mission will bring you game progress. When the progress is full, the game will be considered completed.<br>You will pass through a difficult, winding road with steep ascents and dangerous descents.<br>Be careful not to crash your car.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415640/extras/3c89fb7e647788735cd45de650150dea.poster.avif?t=1684566957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415640/extras/3c89fb7e647788735cd45de650150dea.webm?t=1684566957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415640/extras/3c89fb7e647788735cd45de650150dea.mp4?t=1684566957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Interesting game missions deserve special attention - they drag you into the game process, evoke a feeling of victory.<br>The game has a well-designed winter location, it is amazing and takes you completely into the world of snow,<br>where you can test yourself as the best delivery driver of all time!<br>Game Features :<br>1. Nice graphics<br>2. Interesting game missions<br>3. Well-designed location",
